<title>LUXEMBOURG: Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.07 pct in May.</title>
<headline>Luxembourg yr/yr inflation 1.07 pct in May.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Luxembourg Statistics Office released the following data on inflation -</p>
<p>    LUXEMBOURG CONSUMER PRICES * May	  April	May 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1996)	 100.99     100.87	 n/a</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	+0.12	+0.02	 n/a</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	  +1.07	+1.04	 n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - * index as measured on the first of the month.</p>
<p>Statec said month-on-month price rises were mainly seen for plants, flowers and furniture. For cigarettes and petrol lower prices were recorded.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
